tory tests which likely have their own runner setup.\"},{\"id\":\"phase5\",\"title\":\"Fix Analysis: Decide exact change to apply\",\"status\":\"done\",\"notes\":\"Problem located: SequenceFeatureExtractor.pad returns float64 when given float64 numpy input, and Wav2Vec2FeatureExtractor.__call__ casts float32, but direct pad did not. Fix: override pad in Wav2Vec2FeatureExtractor to cast input_values to float32 before convert_to_tensors.\"},{\"id\":\"phase2\",\"title\":\"Running: Execute tests in repository\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"id\":\"phase7\",\"title\":\"Verification: Run reproduction and related tests\",\"status\":\"todo\"},{\"id\":\"phase8\",\"title\":\"Final Review: Ensure requirements met and tests pass\",\"status\":\"todo\"}]}"}}]}, {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Task list has been updated with 5 items. Stored in session directory: sessions/83e8aed2-f003-41-1edcdaf006ad158/TASKS.md"}], "role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_EM3vNYjMNHffOuAUK6merUbU", "name": "task_tracker"}, {"content": [], "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_LYonSa86FAH2gyVXdIUJsKBa", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "execute_bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"pytest -q tests/test_feature_extraction_wav2vec2.py -q\",\"timeout\":1200,\"security_risk\":\"MEDIUM\"}"}}]}, {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "bash: pytest: command not found\n[The command completed with exit code 127.]\n[Current working directory: /workspace/huggingface__transformers__8e908c8c74f556a82534f4cf1e7a1b4f7b55d24c]\n[Python interpreter: /openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/bin/python]\n[Command finished with exit code 127]"}], "role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_LYonSa86FAH2gyVXdIUJsKBa", "name": "execute_bash"}, {"content": [], "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_Fx2O72wlWLPhc1TTHjnrBoEB", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "execute_bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"pip install -q pytest\",\"timeout\":120,\"security_risk\":\"MEDIUM\"}"}}]}, {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "WARNING: Running pip as the 'root' user can result in broken permissions and conflicting behaviour with the system package manager, possibly rendering your system unusable. It is recommended to use a virtual environment instead: https://pip.pypa.io/warnings/venv. Use the --root-user-action option if you know what you are doing and want to suppress this warning.\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]\n[Current working directory: /workspace/huggingface__transformers__8e908c8c74f556a82534f4cf1e7a1b4f7b55d24c]\n[Python interpreter: /openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/bin/python]\n[Command finished with exit code 0]"}], "role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_Fx2O72wlWLPhc1TTHjnrBoEB", "name": "execute_bash"}, {"content": [], "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_8Qih4oYXINb9CqEhzjmaiCgW", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "execute_bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"pytest -q tests/test_feature_extraction_wav2vec2.py -q\",\"timeout\":1200,\"security_risk\":\"MEDIUM\"}"}}]}, {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/bin/pytest\", line 7, in <module>\n    sys.exit(console_main())\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/lib/python3.12/site-packages/_pytest/config/__init__.py\", line 223, in console_main\n    code = main()\n           ^^^^^^\n  File \"/openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/lib/python3.12/site-packages/_pytest/config/__init__.py\", line 193, in main\n    config = _prepareconfig(new_args, plugins)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/lib/python3.12/site-packages/_pytest/config/__init__.py\", line 361, in _prepareconfig\n    config: Config = pluginmanager.hook.pytest_cmdline_parse(\n                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pluggy/_hooks.py\", line 512, i